eally good exercise as  an actor  i think the most important thing i  learned from  the academy gold program was how  important it is to know every side of  the industry  it's pretty incredible what it takes to  get a film  to the screen and it really makes you  appreciate all the work that goes into  it  i encourage any actor or artist or any  sort of filmmaker with a disability  to get involved in the academy gold  program it's  very inclusive and diverse and  representation absolutely matters  you

